+### Deploy on Wasmer
+
+[![Deploy to Wasmer](https://img.shields.io/badge/Deploy%20to-Wasmer-171717?logo=wasmer&logoColor=white)](https://wasmer.io/apps/create?github=ubaimutl%2Freact-portfolio)
+
+The included `Anybuild` file tells Wasmer to run `npm install` and `npm run build -- --base=/`, so the site is served from the domain root, and to serve the `dist` folder as static files, including the app page for `/about`, `/portfolio` and `/contact` so those links also work when opened directly. `vite.config.js` and `npm run deploy` (GitHub Pages) are unchanged. The button opens Wasmer's import page for this public repository, where you review the detected settings (and correct them if needed) before clicking Deploy; nothing is deployed until you do. It does not create a copy of the repository in your GitHub account. To customize the portfolio, fork the repository, edit `src/content_option.js` (including your EmailJS IDs for the contact form) and import your fork instead.
+
 ### More
 
 Modify pages content in `src/content_option.js`.
